  "student_passage": "Our class opened a small stall at the winter fair. The students brought (1) ____ old toys from home, and the teacher checked that everything was clean. We (2) ____ most of the toys during the first hour. A girl who bought a toy rabbit told us she had wanted one for months.\n\nThe afternoon became much (3) ____ than the morning. We moved the table away from the open door and wrapped the glass jars (4) ____ so that they would not break. Nobody hurried while doing that job, even when a queue began to form. It was our (5) ____ fair as a class, so we were still finding out how to organise things.\n\nWe stayed late (6) ____ the last visitors had only just arrived. Several people had (7) ____ cards and decorations which they wanted to show us before leaving. The younger (8) ____ put their cards beside the jars, and their parents helped them write the prices.\n\nAt the end, we had no (9) ____ about where to put the money: we had promised it all to the school breakfast project. We counted it with the teacher and waited (10) ____ her to write the total on the board. The classroom was untidy, but everyone wanted to do the fair again next year.",
